2|null@NoStupidQuestions^1440527313#3id4s1:Wafflenotblue$:Why dont taser's electricity travel to other people
1|0@NoStupidQuestions^1440527613#cufchae:rednax1206$:Electricity always takes the shortest (least resistant) path it can find. A taser uses two electrical contacts - electricity flows from one contact, through the victim's body to the other contact.
